WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.797
A running total grows as we move through an ordered sequence.

00:00:03.797 --> 00:00:09.987
Imagine daily revenue of one hundred dollars, two hundred dollars, and fifty dollars.

00:00:09.987 --> 00:00:15.126
The running totals become one hundred, three hundred, and three hundred fifty.

00:00:15.663 --> 00:00:21.930
For each row, the calculation includes everything from the beginning of the sequence through the current row.

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:27.437
If we partition by department, each department gets its own independent running total.
